    {
      "id": "b7237176-01a4-4aed-9eb3-64271f3ecd84",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -4528,
        304
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 660,
        "height": 1144,
        "content": "# AI Invoice Generator for Square\n\nTurn a plain-language invoice request into a real, published Square invoice, with automatic customer lookup or creation, card-on-file detection, and optional monthly subscriptions. Built as a sub-workflow: call it from any parent workflow (a Slack bot, chat assistant, form handler) and it returns the public invoice link.\n\n### How it works\n1. The trigger receives invoice details (Name, Email, Item, Amount, Notes, Recurring, Date) from the parent workflow.\n2. An AI Agent (GPT-4o Mini with a structured output parser) cleans the data and converts any date format to YYYY-MM-DD, then a unique invoice number is generated.\n3. Square is searched for the customer by email. If none exists, a new customer is created.\n4. The customer profile is checked for a card on file, then an order and invoice are created and published through the Square API. Square emails the invoice to the customer.\n5. If the invoice is marked Monthly, a subscription plan and variation are created and attached to the customer. Otherwise the public invoice URL is returned to the parent workflow.\n\n### Setup\n1. Add your OpenAI credential to both OpenAI model nodes (replace YOUR_OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID).\n2. Replace YOUR_SQUARE_ACCESS_TOKEN in the Authorization header of every Square HTTP node.\n3. Replace YOUR_SQUARE_LOCATION_ID in the two Create Order nodes and the Attach Subscription node. Run the helper node once to find your location ID.\n4. Call this workflow from a parent workflow and pass the input fields listed on the trigger.\n\n### Customization\n- Edit the invoice description, due date, or accepted payment methods in the Create Invoice nodes.\n- Change the subscription cadence (MONTHLY) in the Create Plan Variation node."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
